# Model weights are downloaded automatically on first run.
# ResNet-18  → cached by torchvision (~45 MB)
# CLIP       → cached by OpenAI CLIP   (~340 MB for ViT-B/32)
# Whisper    → cached by openai-whisper (~74 MB for base)
#
# To pre-download before running the pipeline:
#   python scripts/download_models.py
